<title>SHARJAH: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE BEAT SRI LANKA BY 50 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE BEAT SRI LANKA BY 50 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>SHARJAH, United Arab Emirates 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe beat Sri Lanka by 50 runs in the Sharjah Cup limited overs tournament on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Zimbabwe 203 all out (49.5 overs), Sri Lanka 153 all out (46.1).</p>
</text>
